t1258236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh Cool what\u2019s it gonna be about?</div> </div> </div> </div>The PCs will be ex cons and the like in Gulag,mid 60s russia, when Baba Yaga attacks. Then its intrigue involving the Yagas and the russian government","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T15:12:52-07:00","id":1258434,"title":"","content":"I think our DM has us hunting a Slasher","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Didn't anyone ever tell you not to bring claws to a gun fight?</span></b><br /><br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3786-leicsfox","name":"LeicsFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3786_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-02T06:23:03-07:00","id":1258528,"title":"","content":"Game idea: The PCs play Hunters stalking and eliminating Monsters hiding among people in a village. Except you flip it part-way through and recast the Hunters as Slashers (either a contemporary flip, or it is the ghost of the Hunters still continuing the hunt). You can leave it vague how justified the Hunter are/were as well.<br /> <br /> Or just play it straight - do a Slasher movie from the perspective of the &quot;Slashers&quot;.","